geauctions）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251126/1070308370235265024685247.jpeg/yUaLi468e4PJfWPI7qqXVkJ5RYw6r_1bWT9LP1k_Sz8\"/><figcaption>拍賣行在社媒平台發佈影片，展示了超人第一期漫畫的拍賣過程部分片段，拍賣價一直順利上升。（ig@heritageauctions）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍賣行在社媒平台發佈影片，展示了超人第一期漫畫的拍賣過程部分片段，拍賣價一直順利上升。（ig@heritageauctions）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251126/1070308375772008448259418.jpeg/s5vA9F2b_jqBHF9R4uXPDPBdP-kVdl8acHr-CnB6_go\"/><figcaption>拍賣行在社媒平台發佈影片，展示了超人第一期漫畫的拍賣過程部分片段，拍賣價一直順利上升。（ig@heritageauctions）</figcaption></figure><p>巴斯奇亞《古代科學家》近7,700萬港元領銜亞洲秋季拍場 佳士得告捷</p><p>活到老畫到老！萬和宮最高齡展 退休校長攜百歲人瑞、8旬嬤開畫展</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:05.706204+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1822,"images":20,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:30:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:27:54.223179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:22.424433+00:00","content_hash":"d996bc33e6d20d08ce10af747b0a443a58f765da0054f4d67d7f7055b3a1db67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}